---
/**
 * @category Team
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Team3
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-16'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-10'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:col-span-7 md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Kdo peče Na Růžku</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:col-span-5 dark:text-stone-400'>Zakladatelka s deseti lety u pece a lidé, kteří s ní vstávají, aby v 6.30 byl na pultě teplý chleba.</p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10'>
      <div class='flex flex-col items-start gap-8 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(28_25_23/0.06),0_16px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_25_23/0.18)] ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:col-span-7 md:self-start md:p-8 xl:p-10 dark:bg-stone-800 dark:ring-stone-700'>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-5'>
          <img class='block h-20 w-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover md:h-24 md:w-24' src='/assets/userpics/userpic01.webp' alt='Portrét Ivany Marešové' width='96' height='96' />
          <div class='flex flex-col gap-1'>
            <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Ines Moreau</h3>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Zakladatelka</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class='m-0'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-xl leading-snug tracking-[-0.02em] text-stone-900 text-pretty md:text-2xl xl:text-[1.75rem] xl:leading-[1.3] dark:text-stone-50'>„Deset let jsem nosil návrhy vývojářům a díval se, jak se od nich živý web vzdaluje. Chtěl jsem přesně tohle: návrh přímo na skutečné stránce a kód, který zůstává v repozitáři.“</p>
        </blockquote>
        <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-sans text-base font-medium text-stone-900 no-underline underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Jak pekárna vznikla</a>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col md:col-span-5'>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic05.webp' alt='Portrét Amálie Němcové' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Amálie Němcová</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Cukrářka</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic06.webp' alt='Portrét Jana Nováka' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Jan Novák</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>běhové prostředí Astro</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic07.webp' alt='Portrét Nory Hájkové' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Noor Haddad</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Pekař</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic02.webp' alt='Portrét Oskara Linharta' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Oskar Lind</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Pekař na ranní směně</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic10.webp' alt='Portrét Justýny Tanzerové' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Yuki Tanaka</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Jak objednat</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic08.webp' alt='Portrét Kláry Jandové' width='40' height='40' />
          <div class='flex flex-col'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Klára Jandová</p>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Péče o hosty</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='flex border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-2 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-sans text-base font-medium text-stone-900 no-underline underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Poznat celý tým</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
